{
  "id": "COL.2",
  "number": "2",
  "bookId": "COL",
  "reference": "Abakolosai 2",
  "copyright": "© 2021 KENBS",
  "verseCount": 23,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "2",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "COL 2"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "2",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "COL 2:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nigo nkobamanyia igoro y’omokia inde noro ase engencho yaino, boigo na ase abanto bare Laodikia na baria bonsi batarandora obosio bwane,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "COL.2.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "COL.2.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "COL 2:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nigo ngokora aya onsi erinde baremigwe ase chinkoro chiabo, kobarabwatanigwe ase obwanchani, banyore obonda bwonsi ase okomanya gwonsi gw’ekeene. Ase engencho eyio banyare komanya obobisi bwa Nyasae engencho yaye Kristo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "COL.2.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "COL.2.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "COL 2:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nere ekeigorero ase chinibo chionsi chi’obong’aini na echie chisemi chibisire.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "COL.2.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "COL.2.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "COL 2:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nigo ngokwana ring’ana eri, ng’a monto onde tacha kobang’aina ase amang’ana okoebereria neisa koba nigo bare abaya.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "COL.2.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "COL.2.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "COL 2:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naki nonya tindi nainwe ase omobere, nigo inde amo nainwe ase omoika. Nigo nkogoka ekero nkorora omoroberio oino omuya, na ogwetenenera gw’okwegena kwaino ase Kristo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "COL.2.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "COL.2.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Obogima oboikeranu ime ya Kristo",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "COL 2:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ase ayio, buna mwamoitabire Kristo Yeso buna Omonene, naboigo mogenderere komenya ase okobwatana nere.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "COL.2.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "COL.2.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "COL 2:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Simeka emeri yaino ime ase are, agacha amagima aiono ase are, mokong’igwe ase okwegena buna mworokereretigwe. Na momenteke ase okoiraneria ng’a mbuya mono.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "COL.2.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "COL.2.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "COL 2:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Rigereria monto onde tabaisa kobakora abasakore ase chisemi chiaye chi’oborimo, echio chikorwa ase amorokererio a mwanyabaanto na obong’ainereria bwa bosa na korwa ase emeika y’ense, gose tari buna aya Kristo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "COL.2.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "COL.2.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "COL 2:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naki ime yaye nao oboikeranu bwonsi bw’obonyasae bomenyete ase ekieni ki’omobere.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "COL.2.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "COL.2.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "COL 2:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na inwe mwaerwe obogima ime yaye, ere oyore omotwe bw’abagaambi na obwa bonsi abare nokobua.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "COL.2.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "COL.2.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "COL 2:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ase okobwatanigwa na Kristo boigo mwarokigwe okwaroka gotakoriri namaboko, korende ase okwaroka gokorire na Kristo okwo kogotokora abasibore korwa ase chinguru chi’ebibe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "COL.2.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "COL.2.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "COL 2:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ekiagera ekero mwabatisetwe nigo mwatindegetwe amo na Kristo, na ase ebatiso boigo mokabokigwa na Yeso goetera ase okwegena kwaino ase chinguru chia Nyasae oyomobogetie korwa ase abakuure.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "COL.2.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "COL.2.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "COL 2:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na inwe abamwarenge mokwete ase ogosaria kwaino na ase ogotaroka kw’emebere yaino, Nyasae akabakora koba moyo amo nere, gaikire kobaabera ogosaria gwonsi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "COL.2.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "COL.2.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "COL 2:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ere agatinyia ririiko riria riarigetwe ase amachiiko, riare gotosoera, eriarenge nobobisa ase tore; akaritigeria ensemo, akariakerania ase omosalaba.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "COL.2.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "COL.2.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "COL 2:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naboigo ekero aurire abagaambi na abare nokobua ebirwanero biabo, akabasookia maiso marore, agachenga igoro ase bare ase omosalaba oria.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "COL.2.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "COL.2.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "COL 2:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ase ayio, timwancha koegwa ogochika inwe ase engencho y’ebimokoria gose ebimokonywa, gose ase engencho ye Rituko Rinene, gose okooroka kw’omotienyi, gose Esabato.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "COL.2.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "COL.2.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "COL 2:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amang’ana ayio nekiriri ki’amang’ana agochi‐gocha, korende omoikerania omonyene nere Kristo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "COL.2.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "COL.2.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "COL 2:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Timoa monto onde ribaga ri’okobaura inwe ekeegwa kiaino ase okorigia kwaye ase okweororobia na ase ogosasiima abamalaika, na kwebeka ase amaroro aya arorire, na koenena bosa ase ebirengererio biaye bi’obobe,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "COL.2.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "COL.2.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "COL 2:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "na tabwataini nere oyore Omotwe. Korwa asere omobere bwonsi nigo ogokina ase ogokina gokorwa ase Nyasae, ase okonyora chinguru na kobwatanigwa ase chinengo na emeki.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "COL.2.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "COL.2.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Gokwa na komenya ime ya Kristo",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "COL 2:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gaki, onye mwakuure amo na Kristo, mwatigire amorokererio aye ritang’ani ay’ense, nase ki rende mogendererete buna nab’ense more? Nase ki naende mokoigwera amachiiko buna ayio:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "COL.2.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "COL.2.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "COL 2:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Timokuna, Timoigwa, Timobwata”,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "COL.2.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "COL.2.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "COL 2:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "koreng’ana buna Mwanyabaanto bakoyanyora ase amachiiko na amorokererio abo? (Amang’ana ayio onsi nigo agosareka ekero agokorerwa.)",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "COL.2.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "COL.2.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "COL 2:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ayio nigo akororekana ng’a nay’obong’aini ase ogosasiima na okweororobia na goaka omobere, korende taisaneti gento kende ase ogotanga okogania gwe chingencho chi’obobe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "COL.2.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "COL.2.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
